•	How to model and prototype product upgradability based on engineering metric levels? Defining function attributes and metrics. 
•	How to model the product upgradability at the component level? Identifying the enabling components.
•	What are the structural levels for the upgradability model? Identifying structures and modules of products.
•	What are the alternative solutions and characteristics? Searching for solution principles and their combinations.
•	What are the promising solutions to consider in design for upgradability? Selecting a suitable combination.